# knowledge-navigation 部署清单
# 源:  plugins/knowledge-navigation/
# 标:  /root/.hermes/plugins/knowledge-navigation/
# 影响: Hermes 网关插件；部署完成后将自动重启 hermes-gateway.service
#
# 语法: 每行一个 glob 模式（相对项目根）；以 ! 开头为排除；# 起始为注释。

# === Include ===
__init__.py
src/knowledge_navigation/**/*.py
scripts/**/*.py
config/**/*.yaml
config/**/*.json
plugin.yaml
pyproject.toml
README.md

# === Exclude ===
!**/__pycache__/**
!**/*.pyc
!**/.pytest_cache/**
!**/*.egg-info/**
!**/tests/**
!**/test_*.py
